		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead wight wearing pitch- black robes, with a bestial face and long tongue. A monk who died while violating their precepts.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 21, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +4 (1d8 + <strong>W</strong><strong>I</strong><strong>S</strong> drain) and 1 suck breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources. WIS Drain. 1d4 WIS damage. Coma if reduced to 0 WIS.</p><p></p><p><strong>Suck Breath</strong>. Steal breath of a stunned or helpless target, who suffocates for 1d6 rounds. Kurobozu regains 2d6 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
